{
 "encounter_id": "00939",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Good morning, doctor. I've had a headache at my temple for a couple of weeks, and now my jaw hurts when I chew."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you for coming promptly. That combination is something I want to take seriously. Which temple is it?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "The right one. It's a throbbing pain, and the scalp is tender when I brush my hair."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How long has it been going on?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Two weeks. It's getting worse."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And the jaw pain, when exactly does it happen?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "When I chew. Even a sandwich. I have to stop and rest."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any changes in your vision, double vision, or a curtain coming across?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, not yet. My vision is the same."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any fever, night sweats, or weight loss?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I've felt a bit feverish, but no sweats, no weight loss."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any stiffness in the shoulders or hips in the mornings?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes. I thought that was just my age."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What medicines are you taking?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Just paracetamol, 1 gram, now and then. It's not touching the headache."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any allergies to medicines?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, none."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any other medical conditions?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "High blood pressure, but I take nothing for it. I'm trying diet."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you smoke?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I gave up thirty years ago."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me take your pulse, blood pressure and temperature. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Go on.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Pulse 82, blood pressure 148 over 88, temperature 37.4."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A bit high? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "A little, yes. Now let me feel your temples. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Ouch.",
   "pause": 14.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "The right temporal artery is tender and thickened, and the pulse in it is weak."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "What does that mean? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It makes me worried about giant cell arteritis, which can threaten the vision if untreated. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Do I need treatment now? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Yes. I'd like you to take prednisolone, 60 mg, today, and I'm arranging an urgent blood test and a referral to the eye and rheumatology team."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Steroids? What about the side effects? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "They're a concern, but protecting your sight comes first, and we'll manage the risks. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "All right, if you think that's best. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "If you get any change in vision, call 999 or go to the emergency department at once."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I will. Thank you. ~"
  }
 ],
